---
import ChartLayout from '../layouts/ChartLayout.astro';
import FactRow from '../components/FactRow.astro';
import OncallMascot from '../components/OncallMascot.astro';
import { PROJECT_FACTS } from '../data/projectFacts';
---
<ChartLayout title="The Chart | ONCALL" description="Working identity, unresolved launch facts and explicit limits for ONCALL.">
  <p class="meta">Case file 02 / Admission record</p>
  <h1>The Chart</h1>
  <div class="identity"><div><p class="meta">Working identity / Provisional</p><p class="intro">ONCALL. Night shift. Clear head. Question everything.</p><p>An original mascot-led project about medicine, science and market culture, with a proposed meme token. Name and handle availability have not been established.</p></div><OncallMascot context="note" /></div>
  <section aria-labelledby="facts-heading"><h2 id="facts-heading">Launch facts, still open</h2><p>A working identity is not an immutable token record. No ONCALL launch has been executed. Each field below requires final review and evidence.</p><dl>{PROJECT_FACTS.map((fact) => <FactRow fact={fact} />)}</dl></section>
  <aside class="notice"><h2>Review before the irreversible step</h2><p>Final name, symbol, image, description, and social links must all be reviewed before launch. PAR states that it writes these at launch and they cannot be changed afterward. <a href="https://par.family/docs">PAR launch documentation</a>.</p></aside>
  <section aria-labelledby="limits-heading"><h2 id="limits-heading">What this file does not establish</h2><p>ONCALL is not a medical product, investment product, index fund, or collateralized asset. The proposed quote markets do not guarantee tracking, returns, or safety. Educational content is not diagnosis or treatment advice; market content is not financial advice.</p><p>Read the <a href="/pairs/">candidate quote files</a> and the <a href="/sources-and-risks/">source and risk ledger</a> before drawing conclusions.</p></section>
</ChartLayout>
<style>
  h1 { font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 6vw, 5rem); margin-block: 0.75rem 1.5rem; }
  h2 { font-size: 1.7rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  p + p { margin-top: 1rem; }
  .intro { font-size: 1.45rem; margin-block: 0.5rem 1rem; }
  .identity { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.5rem; }
  section, .notice { margin-top: 2.5rem; }
  .notice { border-left: 4px solid var(--coral); padding: 1.5rem; background: var(--paper-raised); }
  @media (max-width: 35rem) { .identity { flex-direction: column; align-items: start; } }
</style>
